          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumwiiko ne kucha khuwa banamae ba Shamu becha khukhwibwaakala Yoashi. Becha e Yuda ne e Yerusalemu mala babunia babemeelesi boosi be babaandu. Basuta bibiindu bie mu mbaambe bayilila omwami owa Damasika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba banamae ba Shamu ne baba batiiti, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abaelesia bukhili khu banamae ba Yuda ba baaba bakali. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola ario sikila ba Yuda baba balekhile Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe. Mu ngila yino Bashamu bareera kumunaanio khu Yoashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
